message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TensOpSciML: A Python-Based Framework for Tensor Calculus and Differential Operators with Application in Scientific Machine Learning"
abstract: >-
  A unified Python framework for tensor calculus and differential operators for
  data-driven applications, providing convolution-based derivative operators and
  metadata-enriched tensors for Scientific Machine Learning.
type: software
